WEBVTT

01:21.360 --> 01:26.770
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.520 --> 01:29.789
[Episode 29]

01:38.479 --> 01:39.030
My...

01:56.840 --> 01:57.430
Xuruo!

02:04.200 --> 02:04.930
Third Uncle,

02:05.710 --> 02:06.400
Uncle Yu.

02:09.280 --> 02:09.960
I...

02:10.360 --> 02:12.190
wanted to go back to my own quarters.

02:12.190 --> 02:14.150
Your quarters aren't in this direction.

02:14.150 --> 02:16.079
Go back to rest since you're drunk.

02:17.280 --> 02:17.800
Yes.

02:18.470 --> 02:19.200
Then I'll...

02:20.850 --> 02:21.850
take my leave now.

02:30.800 --> 02:32.130
Why did he drink so much?

02:32.590 --> 02:33.270
Jiuheng,

02:33.310 --> 02:34.520
I won't be escorting you
to the bridal chamber.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.240
I'll go keep an eye on him.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.440
Okay, go check on him.

02:36.710 --> 02:38.120
May you be blessed with children soon!

02:38.120 --> 02:38.590
Xuruo!

02:53.000 --> 02:53.930
Third Master...

03:35.840 --> 03:38.670
♪ A good moment is strewn with starlight ♪

03:39.590 --> 03:42.910
♪ Flames burn away
the frost of bygone days ♪

03:43.870 --> 03:47.829
♪ Reflections tremble,
hearts beat in unison ♪

03:49.650 --> 03:52.530
♪ Candlelight weaves the web of fate ♪

03:53.829 --> 03:56.440
♪ Petal shadows
trace the lines of your face ♪

03:57.560 --> 04:01.160
♪ Fleeting light
sketches the shape of fate ♪

04:02.050 --> 04:05.640
♪ Footsteps fall lightly,
yet feelings can't be concealed ♪

04:06.640 --> 04:10.920
♪ In a backward glance,
a few hidden feelings slip through ♪

04:13.270 --> 04:15.380
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

04:16.100 --> 04:17.730
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

04:19.190 --> 04:22.550
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

04:23.750 --> 04:25.510
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

04:27.100 --> 04:30.370
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

04:31.570 --> 04:33.570
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

04:34.380 --> 04:36.090
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

04:37.210 --> 04:41.700
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

04:42.850 --> 04:46.500
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

04:48.540 --> 04:52.490
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

05:10.380 --> 05:13.190
♪ Soft whispers turn into verse ♪

05:14.250 --> 05:17.710
♪ Beneath the bright moonlight,
you and I stand together ♪

05:18.770 --> 05:22.120
♪ Hand in hand, our love deepens
with each passing year ♪

05:23.460 --> 05:28.180
♪ By your side,
I'll follow wherever your heart leads ♪

05:29.870 --> 05:32.180
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

05:32.770 --> 05:34.360
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

05:35.530 --> 05:39.010
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

05:39.870 --> 05:42.370
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

05:43.430 --> 05:47.030
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

05:48.150 --> 05:50.000
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

05:50.870 --> 05:52.590
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

05:53.540 --> 05:58.159
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

05:59.340 --> 06:02.950
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

06:05.040 --> 06:06.070
I've been

06:05.060 --> 06:08.860
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

06:06.310 --> 06:07.510
meaning to ask you—

06:08.800 --> 06:10.070
why do you have

06:10.360 --> 06:11.830
so many scars on your body?

06:13.870 --> 06:15.480
Ever since I've known you,

06:16.430 --> 06:17.270
you've

06:17.270 --> 06:19.270
encountered danger several times.

06:22.160 --> 06:23.950
Aren't you a civil official?

06:24.720 --> 06:26.520
Why do you keep getting injured?

06:26.600 --> 06:27.360
They say,

06:28.240 --> 06:29.630
"When civil officials shun greed

06:29.630 --> 06:31.160
and military officials do not fear death,

06:31.160 --> 06:33.090
an age of prosperity may yet dawn."

06:33.480 --> 06:35.140
But our dynasty is different.

06:36.159 --> 06:38.020
Though it has stood for a century,

06:39.070 --> 06:40.430
it's beginning to show signs

06:40.430 --> 06:42.030
of instability and decline.

06:42.070 --> 06:43.000
Civil officials

06:43.430 --> 06:44.720
must not only refrain from greed

06:44.720 --> 06:46.380
but also have no fear of death.

06:47.310 --> 06:48.800
Only then might there still be hope
for the state.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.659
As expected of a Grand Secretary.

06:51.000 --> 06:52.870
You always talk about
the dynasty's grand legacy

06:52.870 --> 06:54.530
and the welfare of the people.

07:02.560 --> 07:03.770
I know I was wrong.

07:04.630 --> 07:05.600
I really

07:05.830 --> 07:07.890
didn't care enough about my own life.

07:08.270 --> 07:09.670
But from today onward...

07:11.430 --> 07:13.230
I'll take better care of myself.

07:16.240 --> 07:17.640
Then remember this well:

07:18.190 --> 07:18.950
since

07:19.830 --> 07:20.830
I've married you,

07:21.430 --> 07:23.830
you're only allowed to
stay alive and well.

07:27.040 --> 07:27.770
Understood.

07:42.950 --> 07:43.750
What's wrong?

07:49.430 --> 07:50.490
There's something

07:51.240 --> 07:52.240
I have to tell you.

07:54.560 --> 07:55.820
Marquis Changxing...

07:56.950 --> 07:57.750
passed away

07:57.920 --> 07:59.980
in the middle of the night yesterday.

08:03.430 --> 08:04.270
So,

08:05.120 --> 08:07.310
the funeral procession we encountered

08:07.310 --> 08:08.910
on South Gate Street earlier

08:09.480 --> 08:10.240
was...

08:12.680 --> 08:14.940
The court has bestowed 200 taels of gold.

08:15.480 --> 08:16.340
His Majesty has

08:16.560 --> 08:19.000
granted an additional
1,000 taels of silver

08:19.000 --> 08:21.240
and permitted the funeral vigil
to be held at Xuanmiao Temple.

08:21.240 --> 08:22.700
The Ye family should all be

08:22.830 --> 08:24.160
at the temple right now.

08:27.430 --> 08:29.680
Did the court mention anything

08:30.040 --> 08:32.039
about Ye Xian inheriting the title?

08:32.360 --> 08:33.289
What do you think

08:34.750 --> 08:35.809
is more important—

08:36.549 --> 08:37.809
life, or a noble title?

08:40.200 --> 08:42.200
Naturally, life is more important.

08:47.150 --> 08:47.750
His life

08:48.870 --> 08:50.470
should have been preserved.

09:03.500 --> 09:06.240
[Great Merit and High Esteem]

09:06.240 --> 09:06.840
[A Legacy of Virtue and Grace]

09:17.520 --> 09:19.870
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
Late Marquis Changxing of Great Yan]

09:24.440 --> 09:25.270
Miss Xue.

09:30.590 --> 09:31.520
Why are you here?

09:32.720 --> 09:34.520
To offer incense to the Marquis.

09:34.760 --> 09:35.960
If you had come alone,

09:36.030 --> 09:38.030
I might actually have believed you.

09:39.000 --> 09:41.000
But now that you've brought
your husband along,

09:41.000 --> 09:43.600
I can only assume
you come with bad intentions.

09:44.710 --> 09:45.640
Where is Ye Xian?

09:55.790 --> 09:56.440
Ye Xian.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.580
Aren't you here to offer incense?

10:04.120 --> 10:04.930
Go ahead.

10:46.770 --> 10:47.770
I have a few words

10:47.800 --> 10:49.100
to say to Young Lord Ye.

10:49.180 --> 10:50.110
Why don't you...

10:51.010 --> 10:52.320
wait outside?

10:58.550 --> 10:59.500
Miss Xue.

11:13.910 --> 11:15.510
Ye Xian, receive the decree.

11:33.150 --> 11:34.690
Marquis Changxing, Ye Guangsheng,

11:34.610 --> 11:37.800
[Imperial Edict]

11:34.790 --> 11:36.080
fought for the country

11:36.670 --> 11:38.630
with loyalty and valor
worthy of commendation.

11:38.630 --> 11:40.140
Upon hearing the sorrowful news,

11:40.140 --> 11:41.390
I am deeply grieved.

11:42.900 --> 11:46.060
[Ye]

11:48.390 --> 11:49.000
Jinzhao.

11:54.150 --> 11:55.150
I don't blame you.

11:55.960 --> 11:57.690
You had your own choice to make.

11:57.910 --> 11:59.240
You chose Chen Jiuheng.

11:59.870 --> 12:01.000
Ye Xian, foolish as he is,

12:01.000 --> 12:02.400
can only accept his loss.

12:04.440 --> 12:06.770
There's no right or wrong in such matters.

12:07.080 --> 12:08.280
Even if you blamed me,

12:09.270 --> 12:10.400
I wouldn't be angry.

12:11.030 --> 12:11.600
Why?

12:12.520 --> 12:14.580
Because you truly care about Ye Xian.

12:19.150 --> 12:20.440
I mean it.

12:21.720 --> 12:22.440
Thank you

12:23.560 --> 12:25.560
for looking after Ye Xian all along.

12:26.120 --> 12:27.580
You don't need to thank me.

12:28.870 --> 12:30.440
I've just been blind.

12:31.080 --> 12:32.390
The day I come to my senses,

12:32.390 --> 12:34.650
I'll walk away without a second thought.

12:37.870 --> 12:38.470
By the way,

12:39.240 --> 12:41.390
what does your husband
want to say to Ye Xian?

12:41.390 --> 12:42.270
I have no idea.

12:43.670 --> 12:45.400
An owl visiting in the night—

12:45.480 --> 12:46.480
never a good sign.

12:48.120 --> 12:49.150
That reminds me—

12:50.150 --> 12:51.460
there was a time Ye Xian

12:51.720 --> 12:53.510
saw me together with Yanyun,

12:55.270 --> 12:56.730
and he said the same thing.

13:04.000 --> 13:05.670
According to the laws of our dynasty,

13:05.670 --> 13:07.270
his son Ye Xian suffers from illness

13:07.270 --> 13:08.840
and is unfit to inherit the title.

13:08.840 --> 13:11.320
Therefore, the title of
Marquis Changxing is revoked.

13:11.320 --> 13:12.600
Additionally, 200 taels of silver,

13:12.600 --> 13:13.910
500 bolts of silk, and one chest of

13:13.910 --> 13:16.240
calligraphy and paintings are bestowed.

13:16.960 --> 13:18.560
Receive the decree, Ye Xian.

13:24.120 --> 13:25.000
This subject

13:26.030 --> 13:28.030
receives the edict with gratitude.

13:54.030 --> 13:55.030
It was only to be expected

13:55.030 --> 13:57.090
that you wouldn't inherit the title.

13:57.120 --> 13:57.910
Why resort to

13:57.910 --> 13:59.370
such childish theatrics?

14:04.720 --> 14:05.670
His Majesty has another verbal decree

14:05.670 --> 14:06.440
for you.

14:19.870 --> 14:21.440
By His Majesty's verbal decree—

14:21.440 --> 14:23.360
A new Xuanfeng Guard shall be established,

14:23.360 --> 14:24.600
drawing 500 elite troops
carefully selected

14:24.600 --> 14:26.960
from the Imperial Guards
to form its ranks.

14:26.960 --> 14:28.490
Ye Xian is hereby appointed

14:28.630 --> 14:30.560
Commander of the Xuanfeng Guards.

14:31.510 --> 14:33.360
He shall command
the Emperor's personal guards

14:33.360 --> 14:34.780
and hold authority over

14:34.810 --> 14:36.630
supervision and interrogation.

14:36.630 --> 14:37.560
So it is decreed.

14:41.220 --> 14:42.510
This subject obeys the decree.

14:42.510 --> 14:44.640
This subject shall not fail in his duty

14:45.240 --> 14:47.370
and will share His Majesty's burdens.

14:58.270 --> 14:59.550
His Majesty has truly gone to
great lengths

14:59.550 --> 15:00.610
for your sake.

15:01.270 --> 15:02.930
Be sure you prove worthy of it.

15:05.720 --> 15:06.440
Thank you.

15:17.480 --> 15:22.440
[Marquis Changxing's Mansion]

15:24.690 --> 15:26.830
[Memorial]

15:47.910 --> 15:54.250
[Memorial]

15:56.120 --> 15:57.000
You mean

15:57.190 --> 15:59.050
His Majesty played the long game—

15:59.270 --> 16:01.030
first agreeing with
the Senior Grand Secretary

16:01.030 --> 16:02.890
to rescind the Ye family's title,

16:03.240 --> 16:05.910
then using the pretext of
unrest within the palace

16:05.910 --> 16:07.320
to force the Senior Grand Secretary into

16:07.320 --> 16:09.250
establishing the Xuanfeng Guard?

16:09.600 --> 16:10.150
Yes.

16:14.390 --> 16:17.250
Ever since
the late Prince Chengqing's rebellion,

16:17.550 --> 16:18.440
the Penal Court

16:18.870 --> 16:19.840
has long been infiltrated by

16:19.840 --> 16:21.770
various factions within the court

16:21.960 --> 16:23.620
and is no longer trustworthy.

16:23.790 --> 16:25.390
The entire court knows this.

16:26.080 --> 16:27.070
And Ye Xian's

16:27.150 --> 16:29.350
loyalty to His Majesty is unshakeable.

16:29.720 --> 16:30.840
Even my mentor

16:31.510 --> 16:32.910
cannot argue otherwise.

16:33.390 --> 16:35.360
So His Majesty came up with this plan—

16:35.360 --> 16:36.620
both to protect Ye Xian

16:37.080 --> 16:37.810
and to secure

16:38.200 --> 16:39.800
for himself a personal guard

16:40.560 --> 16:42.420
to keep watch over all officials.

16:43.870 --> 16:45.000
That's quite

16:45.750 --> 16:47.200
the calculated move.

16:48.270 --> 16:48.840
Yes.

16:49.870 --> 16:50.730
His Majesty...

16:51.720 --> 16:52.510
has grown up.

16:54.730 --> 16:58.960
[Happiness]

16:57.670 --> 16:59.120
Please have tea, Mother.

17:04.339 --> 17:13.069
[Happiness]

17:14.790 --> 17:17.140
May you love each other dearly

17:17.349 --> 17:19.280
and soon be blessed with children

17:19.700 --> 17:21.230
to carry on the family line.

17:22.000 --> 17:22.550
Yes.

17:23.240 --> 17:24.300
Thank you, Mother.

17:32.070 --> 17:35.270
Second Brother, Second Sister-in-law,
please have tea.

17:36.510 --> 17:37.400
Okay, okay.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.720
My third brother

17:40.110 --> 17:42.270
has always been reserved
yet strong-willed.

17:42.270 --> 17:43.790
Whether in state or family affairs,

17:43.790 --> 17:45.450
he has never once complained.

17:45.640 --> 17:46.640
In the days ahead,

17:46.720 --> 17:48.820
I hope you will take good care of him.

17:49.200 --> 17:51.260
Tend to his needs and care for him well

17:51.440 --> 17:52.880
so that I, as his elder brother,

17:52.880 --> 17:54.440
may feel at ease when away from home.

17:54.440 --> 17:55.720
Why are you being so noisy?

17:55.720 --> 17:56.580
Drink your tea.

18:00.160 --> 18:01.890
Second Brother, I understand.

18:02.030 --> 18:03.490
I'll take good care of him.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.200
Good.

18:05.070 --> 18:05.440
Here,

18:05.830 --> 18:06.690
this is for you.

18:07.110 --> 18:08.640
Thank you, Second Brother,

18:09.240 --> 18:10.570
Second Sister-in-law.

18:11.920 --> 18:12.970
Third Madam,

18:13.240 --> 18:14.300
please have a seat.

18:28.030 --> 18:30.230
Please have tea, Third Sister-in-law.

18:44.750 --> 18:46.610
Thank you, Third Sister-in-law.

18:48.720 --> 18:50.580
Thank you, Third Sister-in-law.

19:03.030 --> 19:04.510
Congratulations, Third Sister-in-law.

19:04.510 --> 19:07.040
Please drink this tea,
Third Sister-in-law.

19:16.590 --> 19:18.450
Thank you, Third Sister-in-law.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.300
Jinzhao,

19:21.440 --> 19:23.100
from now on, we're one family.

19:26.550 --> 19:28.110
Mother and Old Madam Ji

19:28.110 --> 19:29.770
have long been bosom friends.

19:29.880 --> 19:31.230
Now that our two families

19:31.230 --> 19:32.480
have become in-laws as well,

19:32.480 --> 19:34.310
we're truly closer than ever.

19:34.550 --> 19:35.030
Indeed.

19:35.960 --> 19:36.920
Now,

19:37.350 --> 19:39.750
your second sister-in-law
manages the household.

19:39.750 --> 19:41.960
If there's anything you need

19:42.640 --> 19:44.760
or anything you don't understand,

19:45.310 --> 19:47.140
just go to her.

19:47.310 --> 19:48.040
Yes, Mother.

19:48.720 --> 19:49.790
If any maid

19:49.880 --> 19:51.920
or servant gives you trouble,

19:52.070 --> 19:52.830
just tell me.

19:53.310 --> 19:54.770
I'll sort them out for you.

19:55.440 --> 19:56.240
I understand.

19:56.400 --> 19:58.330
Thank you, Second Sister-in-law.

19:58.550 --> 19:59.660
The younger ones

19:59.720 --> 20:01.270
haven't paid their respects
to their aunt yet.

20:01.270 --> 20:01.930
Go quickly.

20:07.880 --> 20:08.650
These two

20:08.720 --> 20:10.790
are my children with your second brother—

20:10.790 --> 20:12.140
Xuansong and Xuanbai.

20:12.350 --> 20:14.350
They came back especially
for the occasion.

20:14.350 --> 20:16.830
Please have tea, Third Aunt.

20:22.000 --> 20:22.930
This is Xuan'an,

20:23.070 --> 20:24.600
Fourth Brother's only son.

20:24.750 --> 20:26.310
He's only just begun his studies.

20:26.310 --> 20:28.160
Please have tea, Auntie Third.

20:29.030 --> 20:30.640
You should call her "Third Aunt."

20:30.640 --> 20:31.920
Third Aunt.

20:44.720 --> 20:46.270
Alright, you may leave now.

20:47.030 --> 20:48.290
Thank you, Third Aunt.

20:55.750 --> 20:56.830
This is Xuanqing.

20:57.030 --> 20:58.030
We've met before.

21:04.550 --> 21:04.960
Right.

21:05.400 --> 21:07.750
When I was still living with
my grandmother in Tongzhou,

21:07.750 --> 21:10.160
Mother and Yanyun both came.

21:10.350 --> 21:11.590
Xuanqing was there too.

21:11.590 --> 21:12.750
Right, right, right.

21:12.750 --> 21:14.060
I remember now.

21:14.440 --> 21:16.400
At your coming-of-age ceremony, right?

21:16.400 --> 21:18.640
Fate truly works in mysterious ways.

21:21.200 --> 21:21.880
Xuanqing.

21:54.160 --> 21:54.620
My Lady!

21:55.550 --> 21:56.010
Well...

21:56.590 --> 21:57.240
Are you alright?

21:57.240 --> 21:57.840
I'm sorry.

21:58.000 --> 21:58.930
I didn't mean it.

21:59.640 --> 22:00.240
Let me see.

22:01.960 --> 22:02.820
You got burned.

22:03.550 --> 22:04.240
I'm fine.

22:06.680 --> 22:08.410
Fetch some Sanhuang Ointment.

22:09.200 --> 22:09.800
It's fine.

22:10.200 --> 22:11.680
The tea was only warm.

22:14.350 --> 22:15.810
Prepare a fresh cup of tea.

22:16.200 --> 22:16.790
No need.

22:17.440 --> 22:19.100
Consider it already offered.

22:23.200 --> 22:23.880
Qingpu,

22:24.200 --> 22:25.300
bring the gift

22:25.400 --> 22:26.270
prepared for Xuanqing.

22:26.270 --> 22:26.750
Yes.

22:38.750 --> 22:39.350
Thank you.

22:40.350 --> 22:41.270
Alright.

22:42.350 --> 22:43.440
I know

22:44.110 --> 22:45.250
you men

22:45.280 --> 22:47.880
have no patience
for all these formalities.

22:48.350 --> 22:49.790
Go on and leave

22:50.680 --> 22:52.650
so we ladies can have a good talk.

22:53.640 --> 22:54.290
Yes, Mother.

22:54.290 --> 22:55.160
Yes, Mother.

22:55.640 --> 22:56.480
Mother,

22:56.750 --> 22:58.750
I hardly think you actually want to chat.

22:58.750 --> 23:01.750
You're just eager to
set up the card table, aren't you?

23:01.830 --> 23:03.780
You needn't rush.

23:03.960 --> 23:04.720
This time,

23:04.750 --> 23:06.680
I've brought a whole box of silver.

23:06.680 --> 23:08.920
You may win to your heart's content.

23:09.030 --> 23:10.090
And if all my money

23:10.120 --> 23:11.320
ends up in your hands,

23:11.440 --> 23:13.500
there's still Third Sister-in-law.

23:13.920 --> 23:15.980
She's the real one with deep pockets.

23:16.070 --> 23:17.440
You cheeky little thing.

23:17.440 --> 23:19.170
I ought to pinch your lips shut!

23:21.590 --> 23:22.200
Mother.

23:24.110 --> 23:25.640
After you, Second Brother.

23:38.110 --> 23:39.510
Second Brother, please.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.070
Okay.

23:40.680 --> 23:41.740
Thank you, Yanyun.

23:43.920 --> 23:45.250
Thank you, Third Uncle.

23:45.920 --> 23:46.750
Back then,

23:47.070 --> 23:48.270
when Lady Jiang died,

23:48.960 --> 23:49.880
you told Mother

23:50.000 --> 23:51.790
you wished to observe mourning rites

23:51.790 --> 23:53.120
and refused to remarry.

23:53.880 --> 23:55.030
And you kept that observance

23:55.030 --> 23:56.200
all these years.

23:57.640 --> 23:58.650
I'd thought

23:58.720 --> 24:00.320
you would never marry again.

24:00.920 --> 24:01.980
Yes, Yanzhang.

24:02.110 --> 24:03.000
Even I myself

24:03.310 --> 24:04.710
didn't expect it either.

24:05.160 --> 24:06.150
Yes, Yanyun.

24:06.270 --> 24:06.960
How exactly

24:07.000 --> 24:08.280
did you and Lady Gu

24:08.310 --> 24:09.110
get together?

24:10.510 --> 24:11.440
Surely it wasn't the Ji family

24:11.440 --> 24:12.880
deliberately presenting her to you

24:12.880 --> 24:14.440
to ensnare you?

24:16.550 --> 24:18.550
What nonsense are you talking about?

24:18.550 --> 24:19.480
Since your third brother has

24:19.480 --> 24:20.410
married Lady Gu,

24:20.830 --> 24:22.490
he naturally has his reasons.

24:22.680 --> 24:24.080
Don't speak carelessly.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.270
Where

24:26.350 --> 24:27.750
did you hear such things?

24:28.920 --> 24:29.720
I...

24:32.270 --> 24:33.590
I heard it from people outside.

24:33.590 --> 24:34.850
Which people outside?

24:40.350 --> 24:41.410
I don't want to hear

24:42.700 --> 24:44.700
this kind of talk a second time.

24:46.720 --> 24:47.720
I know I was wrong.

24:52.030 --> 24:53.400
As for Lady Gu and me...

24:55.070 --> 24:56.130
how should I put it?

24:57.240 --> 24:58.270
It should be—

24:58.830 --> 25:00.720
our hearts entwined the moment we met,

25:00.720 --> 25:02.850
but fate brought us together too late.

25:05.270 --> 25:07.030
This is the first time I've ever seen you

25:07.030 --> 25:08.480
so deeply devoted.

25:09.240 --> 25:10.680
It seems that my third sister-in-law

25:10.680 --> 25:11.880
is no ordinary woman.

25:13.750 --> 25:14.440
But

25:14.720 --> 25:15.520
rest assured.

25:16.350 --> 25:18.810
Since she's the woman
you cherish so dearly,

25:18.960 --> 25:20.690
no one in this entire household

25:21.030 --> 25:21.750
will dare let her

25:21.750 --> 25:23.830
suffer even the slightest grievance.

25:23.830 --> 25:25.110
Since I've married her,

25:25.110 --> 25:25.830
naturally,

25:26.110 --> 25:27.640
I won't let her suffer any grievances.

25:27.640 --> 25:28.550
Of course.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.260
When I saw the grandeur

25:31.350 --> 25:33.030
of your wedding procession yesterday,

25:33.030 --> 25:34.000
oh my,

25:34.790 --> 25:36.440
it would've been grand enough to welcome

25:36.440 --> 25:37.970
a princess into the family.

25:39.510 --> 25:40.570
By the way, Yanyun,

25:41.510 --> 25:42.570
there is something

25:42.960 --> 25:44.020
I wanted to ask you.

25:44.110 --> 25:45.640
Please go ahead, Yanzhang.

25:53.790 --> 25:54.680
I just remembered

25:54.680 --> 25:56.110
the shop manager came earlier.

25:56.110 --> 25:57.750
Maybe there's something wrong at the shop.

25:57.750 --> 25:59.200
Yanzhang, Yanyun,

25:59.440 --> 26:00.240
you guys talk first.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.300
I'll go take a look.

26:01.750 --> 26:02.310
Go ahead.

26:03.310 --> 26:04.000
Then I will

26:04.310 --> 26:05.240
head back first.

26:26.200 --> 26:27.130
Are you alright?

26:29.110 --> 26:29.640
What?

26:30.960 --> 26:32.640
You don't look so well.

26:35.070 --> 26:35.670
Is that so?

26:36.440 --> 26:38.790
Perhaps I didn't rest well last night.

26:42.240 --> 26:43.650
How could you rest well?

26:43.880 --> 26:45.550
There they are discussing court affairs,

26:45.550 --> 26:46.960
and it's understandable to
shut out someone like me

26:46.960 --> 26:48.160
who only handles family business.

26:48.160 --> 26:49.970
But you are a dignified Tanhua,

26:50.160 --> 26:51.270
a future Grand Secretary.

26:51.270 --> 26:52.870
And yet they shut you out too.

26:54.590 --> 26:56.390
I really feel it's unfair to you.

26:57.440 --> 26:58.770
You jest, Fourth Uncle.

26:59.270 --> 27:00.240
I'm a junior.

27:00.590 --> 27:01.960
When elders are discussing matters,

27:01.960 --> 27:03.920
I naturally shouldn't get involved.

27:03.920 --> 27:05.920
How could I possibly feel slighted?

27:07.790 --> 27:08.990
Oh, right, Xuanqing.

27:09.270 --> 27:10.400
You also attended Lady Gu's

27:10.400 --> 27:11.860
coming-of-age ceremony.

27:12.310 --> 27:15.570
So was it really the Ji family
offering her to Yanyun or not?

27:15.640 --> 27:16.440
Of course not.

27:17.200 --> 27:17.880
Really?

27:18.240 --> 27:18.720
Really.

27:23.030 --> 27:24.350
Now that's strange.

27:24.720 --> 27:26.070
If it weren't for her,

27:27.440 --> 27:28.900
how could your Third Uncle

27:28.960 --> 27:29.640
have cared

27:29.640 --> 27:31.160
so much for the Ji family?

27:32.270 --> 27:34.030
Just the land reform case alone—

27:34.030 --> 27:34.680
there was no way the Ji family

27:34.680 --> 27:36.750
could've come out unscathed.

27:39.240 --> 27:41.030
I don't know why Third Uncle

27:41.510 --> 27:43.170
showed favor to the Ji family.

27:43.500 --> 27:45.590
But during the days
of Lady Gu's coming-of-age ceremony,

27:45.590 --> 27:46.270
Third Uncle was with me

27:46.270 --> 27:47.200
the whole time.

27:47.480 --> 27:48.240
He never once

27:48.240 --> 27:49.310
met her alone,

27:49.780 --> 27:52.780
much less anything like
the Ji family offering her up.

27:55.310 --> 27:56.000
You truly are someone

27:56.000 --> 27:58.200
your Third Uncle brought home himself.

27:59.250 --> 28:00.050
Alright then.

28:00.270 --> 28:01.870
If it wasn't, then it wasn't.

28:02.030 --> 28:03.680
He's a Grand Secretary, after all.

28:03.680 --> 28:04.940
Whatever he says goes.

28:05.960 --> 28:06.440
I'm off.

28:14.070 --> 28:14.670
Yunting.

28:15.400 --> 28:16.200
Young Master.

28:17.440 --> 28:18.200
I keep feeling

28:18.200 --> 28:19.630
that something is off with Fourth Uncle.

28:19.630 --> 28:20.640
Think of a way

28:21.000 --> 28:22.660
to keep an eye on him secretly.

28:22.960 --> 28:23.440
Okay.

28:27.750 --> 28:29.390
Yanyun is something else.

28:29.550 --> 28:31.950
It's only the second day
after his wedding,

28:32.240 --> 28:34.840
and he's rushed out
first thing in the morning.

28:36.240 --> 28:37.200
Mother,

28:37.480 --> 28:39.080
Yanyun had official duties.

28:39.200 --> 28:40.920
Someone from the palace
came early in the morning.

28:40.920 --> 28:42.520
If it was official business,

28:43.480 --> 28:45.400
why did he take Zhao along?

28:46.070 --> 28:47.670
Listen to yourself, Mother.

28:47.680 --> 28:49.110
Yanyun dotes on his wife.

28:49.480 --> 28:50.680
That's a good thing.

28:50.680 --> 28:51.350
Doting on his wife

28:51.350 --> 28:52.760
is all well and good,
but not to this extent!

28:52.760 --> 28:55.220
Especially with all those rumors around...

29:05.400 --> 29:06.440
I mean...

29:07.590 --> 29:09.440
Yanyun is willful.

29:09.920 --> 29:11.850
You should've talked him out of it.

29:12.880 --> 29:14.810
Why did you go along?

29:16.310 --> 29:17.160
Because...

29:17.830 --> 29:19.630
I wanted to go in the first place.

29:24.920 --> 29:26.440
Mother, you might not know this.

29:26.440 --> 29:27.970
When I came here yesterday,

29:28.110 --> 29:29.310
I happened to encounter

29:29.310 --> 29:30.750
the Marquis Changxing's household

29:30.750 --> 29:32.150
transporting the coffin

29:32.200 --> 29:34.070
to Xuanmiao Temple on South Gate Street.

29:34.070 --> 29:36.590
By all rights, the deceased
take precedence,

29:36.590 --> 29:38.720
and we should have made way—

29:39.160 --> 29:42.070
especially given that
it was the Marquis's household.

29:42.070 --> 29:43.110
But unexpectedly,

29:43.110 --> 29:43.920
they

29:44.110 --> 29:45.440
made way for us first.

29:45.920 --> 29:47.070
So I've felt

29:47.240 --> 29:49.170
deeply uneasy about it ever since.

29:49.310 --> 29:50.370
And as it happened,

29:50.480 --> 29:51.610
early this morning,

29:51.790 --> 29:53.510
His Majesty ordered Yanyun

29:53.510 --> 29:55.200
to offer incense to the Marquis.

29:55.200 --> 29:56.160
So I thought

29:56.240 --> 29:57.730
I should go along

29:58.030 --> 29:59.030
and offer incense

29:59.400 --> 30:00.880
for the Marquis myself as well.

30:00.880 --> 30:01.830
You are just

30:01.960 --> 30:04.160
too sincere-hearted for your own good.

30:08.440 --> 30:10.240
Mother, Second Sister-in-law.

30:13.680 --> 30:15.440
It was clearly His Majesty's decree.

30:15.440 --> 30:17.500
Why did you take it all upon yourself?

30:17.590 --> 30:18.980
It was His Majesty

30:19.160 --> 30:21.090
who ordered Zhao to accompany you?

30:22.310 --> 30:22.890
Well...

30:23.350 --> 30:25.160
How could that be possible?

30:25.440 --> 30:26.030
Mother,

30:26.240 --> 30:27.750
that was an imperial decree.

30:27.750 --> 30:29.750
It's not something we should question.

30:29.750 --> 30:30.810
Alright, alright.

30:30.830 --> 30:32.240
I won't ask anymore.

30:34.310 --> 30:36.340
There's news from Shanxi.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.370
How about...

30:38.590 --> 30:40.250
you go and help me look into it?

30:40.640 --> 30:42.290
There's news from Shanxi?

30:42.510 --> 30:43.770
Then let's go quickly.

30:45.240 --> 30:45.810
Mother.

30:46.070 --> 30:46.590
Mother.

30:54.070 --> 30:55.830
Why does he also need

30:56.510 --> 30:58.710
Zhao to help with the affairs in Shanxi?

31:00.830 --> 31:01.860
I heard

31:01.920 --> 31:04.080
Jinzhao has business there.

31:04.550 --> 31:06.370
She even donated grain and money

31:06.440 --> 31:08.440
when Pingyang was struck
by a severe drought.

31:08.440 --> 31:09.970
Yes, I heard that too.

31:10.070 --> 31:10.750
Didn't

31:10.750 --> 31:13.080
His Majesty commend her
for it at the time?

31:13.670 --> 31:15.070
With so many businesses,

31:15.110 --> 31:16.880
a young, newlywed wife like her

31:17.790 --> 31:19.920
is even busier than a grand secretary.

31:24.640 --> 31:26.270
You're really good at making things up.

31:26.270 --> 31:27.310
What did I make up?

31:28.270 --> 31:29.030
You actually claimed

31:29.030 --> 31:30.760
that was His Majesty's decree.

31:30.790 --> 31:33.850
Does that count as
falsely invoking an imperial order?

31:36.000 --> 31:37.800
You'll say anything, won't you?

31:41.490 --> 31:43.890
Well, you said
it was His Majesty's decree.

31:44.750 --> 31:45.640
Tell me,

31:46.460 --> 31:48.000
did His Majesty order me

31:48.000 --> 31:50.800
to offer incense
at Marquis Changxing's Mansion?

31:51.510 --> 31:52.460
His Majesty's decree

31:52.460 --> 31:53.370
indeed said so.

31:53.880 --> 31:54.880
And all I said was,

31:54.960 --> 31:56.960
"It was clearly His Majesty's order."

31:56.960 --> 31:58.270
What was wrong with that?

31:58.270 --> 31:59.160
How are you

31:59.400 --> 32:00.830
so full of tricks?

32:03.590 --> 32:05.120
You're no less so yourself.

32:06.960 --> 32:08.030
I only said

32:08.030 --> 32:09.310
that news had come from Shanxi,

32:09.310 --> 32:10.840
yet you played right along.

32:10.880 --> 32:12.480
Well, you'd already come to pick me up.

32:12.480 --> 32:13.720
If I hadn't left with you,

32:13.720 --> 32:14.640
I'd be stupid.

32:15.230 --> 32:17.490
You walked away rather quickly just now.

32:20.310 --> 32:22.680
You've suffered grievances because of me.

32:22.680 --> 32:23.970
Those things

32:24.070 --> 32:25.070
are nothing to me.

32:26.200 --> 32:27.070
Mother

32:27.550 --> 32:28.830
is not a bad person at heart.

32:28.830 --> 32:29.830
It's just that our marriage

32:29.830 --> 32:31.160
wasn't arranged by her,

32:31.240 --> 32:33.160
so she's just displeased.

32:34.020 --> 32:35.330
Most of it falls on me.

32:35.510 --> 32:38.240
I'm sorry that you've been
caught up in it as well.

32:38.480 --> 32:39.480
But fortunately,

32:40.680 --> 32:41.750
Mother is

32:41.920 --> 32:43.720
a bit of a snob.

32:44.350 --> 32:45.550
Seeing that I've

32:45.920 --> 32:47.850
brought honor to the whole family,

32:47.920 --> 32:49.310
she won't do anything unreasonable.

32:49.310 --> 32:50.440
Oh my,

32:50.750 --> 32:51.880
you're actually calling Mother

32:51.880 --> 32:53.340
snobbish behind her back?

32:53.790 --> 32:54.750
Later,

32:55.000 --> 32:56.720
I'll secretly tell her.

32:57.880 --> 32:58.640
Really?

33:02.080 --> 33:03.160
You're asking for trouble.

33:03.160 --> 33:04.310
Put me down.

33:20.070 --> 33:22.130
I'll talk. I'll tell you everything!

33:43.000 --> 33:44.240
Ye Xian! Ye Xian!

33:45.110 --> 33:46.910
I'll tell you everything I know!

33:46.990 --> 33:47.840
Everything.

33:48.160 --> 33:48.960
Just let me go.

33:51.160 --> 33:51.690
Alright.

33:53.000 --> 33:53.800
Wang Xuanfan!

33:54.240 --> 33:55.240
Wang Xuanfan has ties...

33:55.240 --> 33:57.370
has ties with the bandits in Shandong!

34:00.440 --> 34:00.840
And...

34:02.120 --> 34:04.050
In the disaster relief grain case,

34:04.270 --> 34:05.870
that Secretary surnamed Sun

34:06.880 --> 34:08.480
was killed by the men he sent.

34:12.800 --> 34:13.320
Also,

34:14.440 --> 34:15.699
in Daming Prefecture,

34:16.070 --> 34:18.060
he's concealed over 1,000 men

34:18.150 --> 34:19.840
and tens of thousands of acres
of fertile land.

34:19.840 --> 34:20.699
Anything else?

34:21.590 --> 34:22.110
Also...

34:24.790 --> 34:26.790
The wealthy merchants in Shanxi...

34:27.670 --> 34:28.620
On the surface,

34:28.639 --> 34:30.320
he accepts their bribes.

34:31.230 --> 34:32.360
But in secret,

34:32.840 --> 34:33.920
he's been colluding and trading

34:33.920 --> 34:34.989
with the northern tribes

34:34.989 --> 34:36.030
through them!

34:42.670 --> 34:43.409
What else?

34:43.710 --> 34:45.310
That's it. That's all I know.

34:59.440 --> 35:00.670
Ye Xian!

35:01.280 --> 35:02.920
I'll kill you!

35:06.110 --> 35:06.890
Let go of me!

35:07.150 --> 35:08.150
Ye Xian!

35:14.710 --> 35:17.190
Zhang Ling, the former Commander
of the Penal Court,

35:17.190 --> 35:19.030
has admitted that his crimes were grave.

35:19.030 --> 35:20.160
By His Majesty's secret decree,

35:20.160 --> 35:22.000
he is hereby sentenced to execution.

35:22.000 --> 35:23.840
Throw his body into the mass grave

35:23.840 --> 35:24.500
and bury it.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.110
Yes, sir!

35:38.920 --> 35:40.230
Zhang Ling is dead?

35:40.590 --> 35:41.030
Yes.

35:41.360 --> 35:43.760
They say
he committed suicide out of guilt.

35:45.880 --> 35:46.710
Impossible.

35:47.960 --> 35:49.690
He valued his life too much to die.

35:49.690 --> 35:50.340
Then...

35:50.630 --> 35:51.840
could it be because the Ye family

35:51.840 --> 35:53.370
was stripped of their title

35:53.710 --> 35:55.310
that Ye Xian, in a fit of rage,

35:55.550 --> 35:56.670
took his anger out on Zhang Ling?

35:56.670 --> 35:57.800
Did you see the body?

35:59.590 --> 36:00.230
Well...

36:01.000 --> 36:02.030
The Xuanfeng Guards

36:02.030 --> 36:03.840
are all personally selected
by His Majesty.

36:03.840 --> 36:04.590
Our people

36:04.590 --> 36:07.000
haven't had the chance
to be planted inside yet.

36:07.000 --> 36:07.460
Master,

36:07.760 --> 36:08.990
are you suspecting

36:09.070 --> 36:09.510
that it was him...

36:09.510 --> 36:10.150
Master!

36:12.280 --> 36:13.150
The Wang family had someone

36:13.150 --> 36:14.230
deliver the guest list for next month's

36:14.230 --> 36:15.090
tea gathering.

36:15.110 --> 36:17.440
As expected, there was
no sign of Gu Jin...

36:17.550 --> 36:18.480
Jinzhao's name.

36:35.320 --> 36:36.670
I've loaded Master's luggage
onto the cart.

36:36.670 --> 36:38.870
Take good care of Master on the journey.

36:38.920 --> 36:40.380
Rest assured, Changshun.

36:46.110 --> 36:47.710
You needn't wait any longer.

36:48.320 --> 36:49.880
Today is the Eldest Miss's
first return home after her wedding.

36:49.880 --> 36:51.710
No one from the family
will come to see you off.

36:51.710 --> 36:52.960
It's just me.

36:53.320 --> 36:55.650
But they shouldn't just
send no one at all.

36:58.550 --> 36:59.320
Master,

36:59.800 --> 37:00.510
go.

37:01.190 --> 37:02.850
The road to Pingyang is rough.

37:03.110 --> 37:05.170
We mustn't be late for taking office.

37:22.150 --> 37:24.150
"Had you known it would end this way,

37:24.480 --> 37:26.680
would you still have done what you did?"

37:27.800 --> 37:29.700
It's too late

37:29.730 --> 37:31.700
to regret it now.

37:37.070 --> 37:37.670
Go.

37:38.190 --> 37:39.510
Take good care of Master on the road.

37:39.510 --> 37:40.070
Will do!

37:40.510 --> 37:40.960
Hyah!

37:45.920 --> 37:49.580
[Gu]

37:46.590 --> 37:48.110
What time is it already?

37:48.230 --> 37:49.890
Why haven't they arrived yet?

37:50.000 --> 37:51.840
Quick, send someone to check

37:51.840 --> 37:52.790
where they are!

37:52.920 --> 37:54.760
I've already sent someone.

37:55.440 --> 37:57.590
Now that Zhao's become
a Grand Secretary's wife,

37:57.590 --> 37:59.440
she's certainly putting on airs—

37:59.440 --> 38:00.510
making the whole family

38:00.510 --> 38:01.770
wait for her like this.

38:02.000 --> 38:04.530
Isn't she afraid of
using up her good fortune?

38:05.800 --> 38:07.070
Old Madam, Old Madam!

38:09.550 --> 38:10.110
Well?

38:10.480 --> 38:11.340
Where are they?

38:11.360 --> 38:12.920
They're...

38:13.110 --> 38:13.800
Spit it out!

38:13.800 --> 38:14.320
Well...

38:14.920 --> 38:16.070
O-Old Madam, Master,

38:16.070 --> 38:16.630
Madam,

38:17.630 --> 38:19.160
Eldest Miss and her husband

38:19.440 --> 38:20.570
aren't coming here.

38:21.630 --> 38:22.890
Then where did they go?

38:23.840 --> 38:24.710
They said

38:25.030 --> 38:26.490
they've gone to Tongzhou.

38:27.090 --> 38:28.070
Tongzhou?

38:28.800 --> 38:29.280
Well...

38:30.030 --> 38:30.960
What about Rong?

38:30.960 --> 38:33.220
Is he still at the Qifang Hutong Academy?

38:33.280 --> 38:34.130
I asked.

38:34.230 --> 38:35.230
Young Master Rong

38:35.230 --> 38:36.510
left the academy yesterday

38:36.510 --> 38:38.040
and went to Tongzhou first.

38:39.680 --> 38:44.500
[Gu]

38:40.550 --> 38:41.150
You...

38:46.190 --> 38:47.190
Let's go back too.

38:47.400 --> 38:48.730
-Yes, My Lady.
-Mother.

38:49.230 --> 38:49.760
Gu Lan!

38:53.830 --> 38:55.540
Did you know all along

38:55.700 --> 38:56.690
that Gu Jinzhao

38:56.880 --> 38:58.340
wasn't coming back today?

38:58.400 --> 38:59.600
How would I know that?

39:00.920 --> 39:02.620
Stop pretending.

39:03.510 --> 39:04.590
Do you think

39:04.620 --> 39:06.150
that with Gu Jinzhao marrying Chen Yanyun,

39:06.150 --> 39:08.510
you'll get to rise in status
along with her?

39:08.510 --> 39:09.410
Lian.

39:09.550 --> 39:10.480
Stop dreaming.

39:10.740 --> 39:12.510
She doesn't care about you at all.

39:12.510 --> 39:13.510
She's long taken Rong

39:13.510 --> 39:14.110
back to Tongzhou,

39:14.110 --> 39:15.440
leaving you here alone.

39:17.440 --> 39:19.220
Tongzhou is Zhao's maternal family.

39:19.220 --> 39:20.800
It's only natural
that she wouldn't take me along.

39:20.800 --> 39:21.940
So what if I'm alone?

39:22.080 --> 39:23.650
Can't I live my life alone?

39:23.920 --> 39:24.880
I have my own ways

39:24.880 --> 39:25.710
of getting by.

39:34.590 --> 39:35.670
-Go.
-Go.

39:36.510 --> 39:38.480
The nerve of you!

39:48.110 --> 39:48.920
Oh, you.

39:49.230 --> 39:51.430
If you don't want to go back, just don't.

39:51.560 --> 39:53.510
Why did you intentionally not tell them?

39:53.510 --> 39:55.480
If I had told Grandmother in advance,

39:55.480 --> 39:56.740
with her temperament,

39:56.920 --> 39:58.760
she would certainly have
invoked family ethics and filial duty

39:58.760 --> 39:59.620
to pressure me.

40:00.590 --> 40:01.440
And then,

40:01.670 --> 40:03.150
for the sake of your reputation,

40:03.150 --> 40:04.950
I'd have no choice but to give in.

40:05.280 --> 40:07.190
So it was better not to tell her at all—

40:07.190 --> 40:08.790
act first, inform her after,

40:08.800 --> 40:10.460
and leave her no time to react.

40:10.670 --> 40:11.590
So in the end,

40:12.030 --> 40:13.230
it's my fault.

40:13.760 --> 40:14.590
Yes.

40:16.440 --> 40:18.630
Just because you're
a dignified Grand Secretary,

40:18.630 --> 40:19.800
in everything you do,

40:19.800 --> 40:21.550
you have to be a model for others.

40:21.550 --> 40:22.360
Therefore, there are so many things

40:22.360 --> 40:23.440
I can no longer do.

40:26.070 --> 40:26.670
Oh?

40:28.880 --> 40:30.410
And what is it you wish to do?

40:34.600 --> 40:36.760
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

40:37.500 --> 40:39.090
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

40:40.270 --> 40:43.690
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

40:44.600 --> 40:46.980
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

40:48.170 --> 40:51.760
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

40:52.880 --> 40:54.730
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

40:55.600 --> 40:57.200
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

40:58.290 --> 41:02.910
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

41:04.070 --> 41:07.690
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

41:09.790 --> 41:13.300
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

41:11.590 --> 41:12.190
Oh, right.

41:12.760 --> 41:14.360
At the banquet the other day,

41:14.630 --> 41:16.120
Mu mentioned

41:16.230 --> 41:17.290
that his eldest son

41:17.360 --> 41:18.960
wishes to seek your third sister's hand
in marriage.

41:18.960 --> 41:20.090
What a mood-killer.

41:25.000 --> 41:26.550
The eldest son of the Mu family,

41:26.550 --> 41:27.510
Mu Zhidi?

41:30.230 --> 41:31.480
Before my mother passed away,

41:31.480 --> 41:33.230
he'd already brought it up once.

41:33.230 --> 41:33.960
But

41:33.960 --> 41:35.400
that was three years ago.

41:36.920 --> 41:37.960
I thought Young Master Mu

41:37.960 --> 41:39.560
had already been betrothed.

41:40.550 --> 41:41.480
I'm afraid

41:41.710 --> 41:43.170
this match won't work out.

41:45.110 --> 41:45.880
At that time,

41:46.000 --> 41:47.600
Lan had already refused him.

41:47.840 --> 41:48.700
Besides,

41:49.000 --> 41:51.930
she found Young Master Mu
looked too simple-minded.

41:52.360 --> 41:53.590
Corrupt official, get out!

41:53.590 --> 41:55.210
Give us an explanation!

41:55.360 --> 41:56.710
-Get out!
-Give us an explanation!

41:56.710 --> 41:57.670
Corrupt official!

41:57.670 --> 41:59.000
Explain yourself to us!

41:59.000 --> 42:00.190
Corrupt official, get out

42:00.190 --> 42:01.430
and explain!

42:01.630 --> 42:02.430
Third Master,

42:02.590 --> 42:04.230
there are seven or eight
young scholars ahead

42:04.230 --> 42:05.360
blocking the road with banners.

42:05.360 --> 42:06.190
They read:

42:07.000 --> 42:09.440
"Unjust land reform—
all under heaven cries out."

42:09.440 --> 42:10.630
They also mention imperial lands

42:10.630 --> 42:11.690
and noble estates.

42:12.230 --> 42:13.920
Get out now, corrupt official!

42:13.920 --> 42:15.510
This feels rather suspicious.

42:15.510 --> 42:17.190
I'll go take a look. Wait here.

42:17.510 --> 42:18.190
Okay.

42:18.440 --> 42:19.670
Be careful then.

42:22.670 --> 42:23.920
Give us an explanation!

42:23.920 --> 42:25.110
We deserve an explanation!

42:25.110 --> 42:26.170
Corrupt official,

42:26.440 --> 42:27.190
give us an explanation!

42:27.190 --> 42:28.070
Seize them all

42:28.230 --> 42:29.550
and question them one by one.

42:29.550 --> 42:30.210
Squat down!

42:31.230 --> 42:32.560
Take them further away.

42:33.030 --> 42:34.550
-Don't startle the Madam.
-Get down! Down!

42:34.550 --> 42:35.070
Yes.

42:35.590 --> 42:36.190
My Lady.

42:36.710 --> 42:37.840
These scholars

42:38.150 --> 42:38.710
actually knew

42:38.710 --> 42:39.920
we would pass by here.

42:40.510 --> 42:42.550
Someone must have instructed them.

42:44.840 --> 42:47.000
There is no shortage of people
who resent Yanyun.

42:47.000 --> 42:47.360
But

42:47.360 --> 42:49.110
those capable of stirring up scholars
to cause

42:49.110 --> 42:50.710
this kind of trouble are few.

43:01.070 --> 43:01.870
Third Master,

43:01.880 --> 43:03.000
that fellow confessed.

43:03.000 --> 43:04.670
It was a servant
from Wang Xuanfan's household

43:04.670 --> 43:06.360
who instructed them
to remonstrate with you

43:06.360 --> 43:07.150
and revealed our whereabouts

43:07.150 --> 43:07.880
to them.

43:10.510 --> 43:11.530
Wang Xuanfan...

43:11.800 --> 43:13.760
I made him pay
tens of thousands more taels in taxes,

43:13.760 --> 43:15.890
and it seems he's come to truly hate me.

43:16.070 --> 43:16.670
Well then,

43:17.510 --> 43:18.710
assign two men

43:19.150 --> 43:21.550
to escort them back to the capital
and have them detained.

43:21.550 --> 43:22.750
Treat them properly.

43:23.150 --> 43:24.480
As for everything else,

43:24.630 --> 43:25.710
we'll talk about it when we get back.

43:25.710 --> 43:26.240
Yes, sir.

43:31.550 --> 43:32.190
Third Master.

43:32.190 --> 43:33.050
What happened?

43:33.160 --> 43:34.420
Our men were ambushed.

43:44.670 --> 43:45.330
Jinzhao...

43:59.080 --> 44:02.550
[A Splendid Match]
